<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed all four credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.644  bln pesos 17 days  32.80  32.46   32.67    7    4</p>
<p>1.644  bln pesos 11 days  32.61  32.56   32.56    2    2</p>
<p>1.645  bln pesos  7 days  32.59  32.30   32.48   12    4</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos  3 days  32.59  32.10   32.12    6    4</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
